---

GitHub Control

Organization

MouyX-Technologies

Recommended controls

- Require 2FA where available
- Use teams for repository permissions
- Protect production branches
- Require pull requests
- Require CI checks
- Disable unnecessary force pushes
- Enable security scanning
- Enable Dependabot where appropriate
- Use GitHub Environments for deployment
- Store secrets in GitHub Secrets

---

Repository Control

Every production repository should have:

.github/
.vscode/
.cursor/
docs/
scripts/
src/
tests/

.env.example
.gitignore
README.md
SECURITY.md
LICENSE

Branch model

main
  │
  ├── develop
  │
  ├── feature/*
  ├── fix/*
  ├── security/*
  └── release/*

Production flow:

feature
   ↓
Pull Request
   ↓
CI / Security Checks
   ↓
develop
   ↓
Staging
   ↓
Production Approval
   ↓
main

