AI Agent Registry

Jules

Role:

DevOps / Repository Orchestration Agent

Recommended permissions:

- Repository maintenance
- CI/CD
- Documentation
- Pull requests
- Issue management

Do not automatically give organization-owner privileges.

Gemini

Role:

AI Development / Research / Documentation

Recommended permissions:

- Code assistance
- Documentation
- Research
- Pull-request preparation

Cursor

Role:

Local Development / Coding Assistant

Recommended permissions:

- Local repository development
- Code generation
- Refactoring
- Pull-request preparation

