---

Secret Management

Never place real secrets in:

- Gists
- README files
- Source code
- ".env" files committed to Git
- Issues
- Pull requests
- Public repositories

Use placeholders:

GITHUB_TOKEN=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
JULES_API_KEY=
CONTABO_API_KEY=
MT5_LOGIN=
MT5_PASSWORD=
BROKER_API_KEY=

Store actual values in the appropriate secret manager.

