---

Operating Rule

The Gist is a control registry, not the production source of truth.

Production code belongs in GitHub repositories.

Credentials belong in secret storage.

Infrastructure configuration belongs in version-controlled repositories.

The Gist provides a lightweight map of how everything is connected.
